<title>FRANCE: MOTORCYCLING-FRENCH GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-FRENCH GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>LE CASTELLET, France 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in</p>
<p>Friday's first official qualifying session for Sunday's 500cc</p>
<p>motorcycle Grand Prix:</p>
<p> 1. Alex Criville (Spain) Honda	 One minute 21.456 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda  1:21.737</p>
<p> 3. Doriano Romboni (Italy) Aprilia   1:21.916</p>
<p> 4. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda	  1:21.977</p>
<p> 5. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda	1:22.061</p>
<p> 6. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Yamaha	1:22.324</p>
<p> 7. Alberto Puig (Spain) Honda	  1:22.552</p>
<p> 8. Juan Borja (Spain) Honda	    1:22.660</p>
<p> 9. Alex Barros (Brazil) Honda	  1:22.712</p>
<p>10. Daryl Beattie (Australia) Suzuki 1:22.892</p>
